(805, 'Product Marketing Executive', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Product Marketing Executive is responsible for assisting in the management of product marketing. He/She conducts market analyses to develop strategies that grow the organisation''s bottom line, market share and marginal goals through successful product marketing and campaigns. He is also responsible for generating ideas and conducting market research to understand client behaviours and market trends to launch successful campaigns. The Product Marketing Executive is creative and contributes new ideas to marketing strategies on a regular basis. He is comfortable with performing market research to understand market trends and perform client analyses. He possesses strong time management and analytical skills and reporting abilities. The Product Marketing Executive is required to acquire specific product knowledge and this can include either one or a combination of: retail banking products, investment banking products, asset management products, private banking products and insurance products.', 112, '1', '2026-09-29 00:00:00', NULL),
